        "text": "So I\u2019m building what I call a GTM Engine to help me figure that out. It looks at the code behind what I\u2019ve built, then researches who might need it and what they\u2019re using already.\nThat helps me work out what to test. I\u2019d still wanna let someone try what I\u2019ve built on something they actually need to do, and see whether they choose it over their usual way."
